## Testing Accessibility

### Manual Testing Checklist
- [ ] Test keyboard navigation (Tab, Enter, Escape, Arrow keys)
- [ ] Test with screen reader (NVDA, JAWS, or VoiceOver)
- [ ] Test form validation and error messages
- [ ] Test focus management and focus traps
- [ ] Test color contrast with accessibility tools
- [ ] Test on various screen sizes (320px, 375px, 768px, 1024px, 1920px)
- [ ] Test with browser zoom (200%)

### Automated Testing
- Use `@axe-core/react` for automated accessibility testing
- Use `jest-axe` in unit tests
- Use Playwright accessibility testing in E2E tests
- Run Lighthouse accessibility audits

